        {"$GMRTextItem":"v3","%Name":"text_344795B1","alignment":1,"charSpacing":0.0,"colour":4294967295,"fontId":{"name":"font_console","path":"fonts/font_console/font_console.yy",},"frameH":0.0,"frameW":0.0,"frozen":false,"ignore":false,"inheritedItemId":null,"inheritItemSettings":false,"lineSpacing":0.0,"name":"text_344795B1","paragraphSpacing":0.0,"resourceType":"GMRTextItem","resourceVersion":"2.0","rotation":0.0,"scaleX":1.0,"scaleY":1.0,"text":"An Velvet Recall Production\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLucasGabriel.zip\r\nDirector, Project Lead, Artist\r\n\r\n\r\nJohn Jacob Jingleheimer Schmidt\r\nCoder\r\n\r\nBasikRU\r\nCoder, Artist, Level Designer\r\n\r\nWendy/WendyWorm\r\nCoder\r\n\r\nHoopsAndYoyoFan\r\nSound Designer, Coder, Level Designer\r\n\r\nP4dro\r\nArtist\r\n\r\nBall Man\r\nArtist, Sound Designer, Musician\r\n\r\nMcSpin\r\nArtist\r\n\r\nMixedGoblin\r\nArtist\r\n\r\nNyeeh\r\nArtist, Concept Artist\r\n\r\nEnik\r\nArtist\r\n\r\nCheeserjin\r\nConcept Artist\r\n\r\nDoizeDuck\r\nArtist\r\n\r\nBobbers\r\nArtist\r\n\r\nJoel/Jouwater\r\nConcept Artist\r\n\r\nRiksmile\r\nLevel Designer\r\n\r\nSweeebus\r\nMusician\r\n\r\nGian\r\nPlaytester\r\n\r\nRoro\r\nPlaytester\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGUEST FOLKS\r\nCheeseman - Guest Artist\r\n\r\nBeingday2 - Guest Artist\r\n\r\nShutterstock - Guest Coder\r\n\r\nMrInkbyteWalten (Foxy) - Guest Artist\r\n\r\nOddycie_\r\nmade the completecook logo\r\nused for this\r\n\r\n\r\nthank you so much for playing\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nthis project wouldnt be go as planned\r\nwithout this amazing dev team\r\n\r\nthank you!\r\n","wrap":false,"x":213.5,"y":780.0,},
